    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# Azure Functions - issues and retirement readiness\r\n\r\nFleet-wide view of Azure Function App problems, built entirely on Azure Resource\r\nGraph. Includes dedicated tracking for the **Linux Consumption plan retirement\r\n(30 September 2028)**."
