        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Azure Functions - issue overview\r\n\r\nFindings are derived entirely from **Azure Resource Graph**, so this reflects\r\ncontrol-plane configuration across every selected subscription with no agent,\r\ndiagnostic setting, or Application Insights dependency.\r\n\r\nSee the **About the data** tab for exactly which properties Resource Graph does\r\nand does not expose - some settings (TLS version, FTPS state, CORS) are *not*\r\nretrievable through Resource Graph and are intentionally not shown here."
            },
            "name": "ovHeader"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.web/sites'\n| where kind contains 'functionapp'\n| where kind !contains 'workflowapp'\n| extend _rgs = dynamic([{ResourceGroups}])\n| where array_length(_rgs) == 0 or set_has_element(_rgs, '*') or set_has_element(_rgs, resourceGroup)\n| extend _apps = dynamic([{FunctionApps}])\n| where array_length(_apps) == 0 or set_has_element(_apps, '*') or set_has_element(_apps, tolower(id))\n| extend planId    = tolower(tostring(properties.serverFarmId))\n| extend tier      = tostring(properties.sku)\n| extend isLinux   = tobool(properties.reserved)\n| extend osType    = iff(isLinux == true or kind contains 'linux', 'Linux', 'Windows')\n| extend state     = tostring(properties.state)\n| extend enabledFlag = tobool(properties.enabled)\n| extend httpsOnly = tobool(properties.httpsOnly)\n| extend pna       = tostring(properties.publicNetworkAccess)\n| extend subnetId  = tostring(properties.virtualNetworkSubnetId)\n| extend availability = tostring(properties.availabilityState)\n| extend usage     = tostring(properties.usageState)\n| extend identityType = tostring(identity.type)\n| extend clientCert = tobool(properties.clientCertEnabled)\n| extend defaultHost = tostring(properties.defaultHostName)\n| extend memQuota  = toint(properties.dailyMemoryTimeQuota)\n| extend redundancy = tostring(properties.redundancyMode)\n| extend lastModified = todatetime(properties.lastModifiedTimeUtc)\n| extend alwaysOn  = tobool(properties.siteConfig.alwaysOn)\n| extend http2     = tobool(properties.siteConfig.http20Enabled)\n| extend linuxFx   = tostring(properties.siteConfig.linuxFxVersion)\n| extend scaleLimit = toint(properties.siteConfig.functionAppScaleLimit)\n| extend isConsumption = (tier =~ 'Dynamic')\n| extend isFlex        = (tier =~ 'FlexConsumption')\n| extend isServerless  = (isConsumption or isFlex)\n| extend TierLabel = case(\n      tier =~ 'Dynamic',         'Consumption (Y1)',\n      tier =~ 'FlexConsumption', 'Flex Consumption',\n      tier =~ 'ElasticPremium',  'Premium (Elastic)',\n      isempty(tier),             'Unknown',\n      tier)\n| extend isLinuxConsumption = (isConsumption and osType == 'Linux')\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.web/serverfarms'\n    | project planId = tolower(id),\n              planName = name,\n              planSkuName = tostring(sku.name),\n              planSkuTier = tostring(sku.tier),\n              planCapacity = toint(sku.capacity),\n              planZoneRedundant = tobool(properties.zoneRedundant)\n  ) on planId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resourcecontainers\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions'\n    | project subscriptionId, Subscription = name\n  ) on subscriptionId\n| extend SkuDisplay = strcat(coalesce(planSkuTier, tier), iff(isnotempty(planSkuName), strcat(' (', planSkuName, ')'), ''))\n| extend IssueList = array_concat(\n    iff(isLinuxConsumption == true,                     pack_array('Linux Consumption retiring 30 Sep 2028'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(httpsOnly != true,                              pack_array('HTTPS-only disabled'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(state !~ 'Running' or enabledFlag == false,      pack_array('Stopped or disabled'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(isempty(identityType) or identityType =~ 'None', pack_array('No managed identity'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(isnotempty(availability) and availability !~ 'Normal', pack_array(strcat('Availability: ', availability)), dynamic([])),\n    iff(isnotempty(usage) and usage !~ 'Normal',         pack_array(strcat('Usage state: ', usage)), dynamic([])),\n    iff(isnotnull(alwaysOn) and alwaysOn == false and isServerless == false, pack_array('Always On disabled'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(pna =~ 'Enabled' and isempty(subnetId),          pack_array('Public network access, no VNet integration'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(isnotnull(http2) and http2 == false,             pack_array('HTTP/2 disabled'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(memQuota > 0,                                    pack_array('Daily memory quota cap set'), dynamic([])),\n    iff(clientCert != true and isempty(subnetId),        pack_array('No client certificate requirement'), dynamic([]))\n  )\n| extend IssueCount = array_length(IssueList)\n| extend Issues     = strcat_array(IssueList, ' | ')\n| extend Severity = case(\n      isLinuxConsumption == true and IssueCount >= 3, 'Critical',\n      isLinuxConsumption == true,                     'High',\n      IssueCount >= 5,                                'High',\n      IssueCount >= 2,                                'Medium',\n      IssueCount >= 1,                                'Low',\n                                                      'Healthy')\n| extend SeverityRank = case(Severity == 'Critical', 0, Severity == 'High', 1, Severity == 'Medium', 2, Severity == 'Low', 3, 4)\n| summarize\n    TotalApps    = count(),\n    LinuxCons    = countif(isLinuxConsumption == true),\n    AtRisk       = countif(IssueCount > 0),\n    CriticalHigh = countif(Severity in ('Critical','High')),\n    Stopped      = countif(state !~ 'Running' or enabledFlag == false),\n    NoIdentity   = countif(isempty(identityType) or identityType =~ 'None'),\n    NoHttps      = countif(httpsOnly != true)\n| extend Tiles = pack_array(\n    pack('Metric', 'Function apps',            'Value', TotalApps,    'Rank', 1),\n    pack('Metric', 'Linux Consumption (retiring)', 'Value', LinuxCons, 'Rank', 2),\n    pack('Metric', 'Apps with findings',       'Value', AtRisk,       'Rank', 3),\n    pack('Metric', 'Critical or high',         'Value', CriticalHigh, 'Rank', 4),\n    pack('Metric', 'Stopped or disabled',      'Value', Stopped,      'Rank', 5),\n    pack('Metric', 'No managed identity',      'Value', NoIdentity,   'Rank', 6),\n    pack('Metric', 'HTTPS-only disabled',      'Value', NoHttps,      'Rank', 7))\n| mv-expand Tiles\n| project Metric = tostring(Tiles.Metric), Value = toint(Tiles.Value), Rank = toint(Tiles.Rank)\n| order by Rank asc",
